// nine-rung ladder, whose own report.md that module wrote on 2026-08-08 and
// could not have regenerated the day after v2 landed. The rule is a STRICT
// PREFIX and the tests pin all four edges: a v1 file reads with the absent
// columns as None (never 0), the exact reader still refuses that same file, a
// REORDERED header is refused (a prefix is not a subset -- swapping two columns
// keeps the name set identical and changes every value's meaning), and a NEWER
// version is refused. One more pins the schema property the whole scheme rests
// on: that v2's five columns really are appended at the END, so a later version
// inserting a column in the middle fails here instead of silently misreading
// every archived tree.
